# Reproduce the SINTRAN ERRFATAL (bare & = ALD Winchester autoboot) on the
# CACHE-enabled addr16 bitstream, then use OPCOM (CPU drops to STOP at the
# ERRFATAL WAIT) to dump the evidence:
#   ERRFA entry saves: 4347=X 4350=T 4351=A 4352=D 4353=L
#     T = driver software status: 0=hw error (X=status), 1=bank>377,
#         4=memory address register mismatch, 10=log addr outside device,
#         100=illegal code, 200=controller not active after activate
#   WD driver datafield (B=042346): 42244=SSTAT(last IOX 504 status),
#     42273=BADTR 42274=WANKN 42300=SEEKF 42305=TRTZ 42311=BUSFL
#     42312=SVLCA 42313=SVLWC
LABEL boot SINTRAN via bare & (ALD default = Winchester)
SEND &
LABEL waiting for ERRFATAL
EXPECT 300 ERRFATAL
PAUSE 10
LABEL trying OPCOM at the halt
SENDCR
EXPECT 10 #
LABEL ERRFA register saves
SEND 4347/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
SEND 4350/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
SEND 4351/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
SEND 4352/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
SEND 4353/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
LABEL WD driver datafield
SEND 42244/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
SEND 42273/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
SEND 42274/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
SEND 42300/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
SEND 42305/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
SEND 42311/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
SEND 42312/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
SEND 42313/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
LABEL live registers at halt
SEND P/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
SEND L/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
SEND T/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
SEND X/
PAUSE 2
SENDCR
QUIET 3
